1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,250
These overcomers who have made themselves ready—

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:05,750
what do they become?

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:08,500
The bride of Christ.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,000
The bridegroom, then, takes the bride.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
John chapter three states clearly:

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,500
He who has the bride is the bridegroom.

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,250
He must increase,

8
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:26,000
but I must decrease.

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,750
We can see that the bride is the increase of the
bridegroom.

10
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:34,250
In other words, the bride is nothing else.

11
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:37,250
Strictly speaking, the bride is not a separate
person.

12
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:38,750
What is the bride?

13
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:41,750
The increase of the bridegroom.

14
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:45,250
You may ask, Is that going too far?

15
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,250
What is the bride?

16
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,500
The increase of the bridegroom.

17
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,750
The Song of Songs the brother just read with us

18
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:53,750
expresses this same thought.

19
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,000
When we reach chapter six of the Song of Songs,

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,250
we find this beloved.

21
00:01:01,250 --> 00:01:04,000
In the earlier chapters, we cannot find her name.

22
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,000
I do not know about you,

23
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
but when I read the Song of Songs as a younger man,

24
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
I wondered if I had misread it.

25
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Had I accidentally missed something?

26
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,250
Why could I not find out her name?

27
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:18,250
Chapter one? No. Chapter two? No.

28
00:01:18,250 --> 00:01:21,750
No name in chapters three, four, or five either.

29
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:24,250
She is simply called the beloved.

30
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,250
No name at all.

31
00:01:27,250 --> 00:01:30,750
Then, in chapter six, a name suddenly appears. What
is it?

32
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:32,750
Shulammite.

33
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:36,500
Actually, the word woman is an addition in the
Chinese translation.

34
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:39,000
It is simply Shulammite.

35
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,750
Shulammite is the feminine form of Solomon.

36
00:01:42,750 --> 00:01:48,000
In other words, this beloved is a female Solomon.

37
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,500
You see, the revelation in the Bible is consistent.

38
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,000
Who is the bride?

39
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,000
The increase of the bridegroom.

40
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
The bride is not a separate person.

41
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,750
She is, in essence, the increase of the bridegroom.

42
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:03,000
Who is the bride?

43
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,000
The bride is the Shulammite,

44
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,750
a female Solomon.

45
00:02:07,750 --> 00:02:09,750
To attain this,

46
00:02:09,750 --> 00:02:11,500
we come to the third point:

47
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,250
maturity.

48
00:02:13,250 --> 00:02:16,250
In the third point we read the word maturity.

49
00:02:16,250 --> 00:02:18,250
What does the original Greek word mean?

50
00:02:18,250 --> 00:02:20,250
Reaching the goal.

51
00:02:20,250 --> 00:02:24,000
Brothers and sisters, I hope you will seriously
enter into this point.
